    <string name="privacy_title">Privacy policy</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">CAPod uses nearby Bluetooth signals to display battery levels, identify paired devices and apply your selected controls. Android 11 and earlier require location permission for Bluetooth scanning. CAPod stores profiles, optional identity keys, settings and battery history on your device. Android may include app data in system backups according to your backup settings. Battery samples older than seven days are removed when new samples are saved. You can clear history in Settings, remove a profile in Devices, or erase all local data in Android app settings. For privacy inquiries, use the developer contact on the CAPod store listing.</string>

